Syntax: cast 'legba's guidance' <target>

Legba's Guidance invokes the wise loa Legba to guide and protect the
target from various forms of harm. Papa Legba, keeper of the crossroads
between the mortal and spirit worlds, bestows his blessing to ward
against dangers both physical and magical.

The guidance grants resistance to:
  - Bleeding wounds and blood loss
  - Earth-based magical attacks and effects
  - Charm and mental domination
  - Disease and sickness

The strength of protection scales with the caster's level, providing
stronger resistance at higher skill. When cast on oneself, the protection
is at full strength; when blessing others, the effect is halved. A
critical success doubles the duration and greatly increases the immunity
percentages.

Legba's Guidance complements Djalla's Protection, which guards against
different types of harm. Together they provide comprehensive spiritual
defense against most magical and environmental threats.

